{"parse":{"title":"Template:PS99DamageProgression","pageid":53145,"wikitext":{"*":"==Damage Progression==\nHuge, Titanic, and Gargantuan pets possess the ability to earn experience points (XP) and level up, enhancing their damage-dealing capabilities by up to +100% at level 99. \n\nThe damage boost percentage for a pet with level L is given by the function:<br><math>\nDamageBoostPercentage(L)=100\\left( \\frac{1}{2}\\left( \\frac{L-1}{98} \\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\left( \\frac{L-1}{98} \\right)^{5}\\right)\n</math>\n\n{| class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed article-table\"\n|+Damage Progression\n!Level\n!Damage Modifier (%)\n|-\n|1\n|0\n|-\n|2\n|5.1\n|-\n|3\n|7.1\n|-\n|4\n|8.7\n|-\n|5\n|10.1\n|-\n|6\n|11.3\n|-\n|7\n|12.4\n|-\n|8\n|13.4\n|-\n|9\n|14.3\n|-\n|10\n|15.2\n|-\n|11\n|16\n|-\n|12\n|16.8\n|-\n|13\n|17.5\n|-\n|14\n|18.2\n|-\n|15\n|18.9\n|-\n|16\n|19.6\n|-\n|17\n|20.2\n|-\n|18\n|20.8\n|-\n|19\n|21.4\n|-\n|20\n|22\n|-\n|21\n|22.6\n|-\n|22\n|23.2\n|-\n|23\n|23.7\n|-\n|24\n|24.3\n|-\n|25\n|24.8\n|-\n|26\n|25.3\n|-\n|27\n|25.8\n|-\n|28\n|26.3\n|-\n|29\n|26.8\n|-\n|30\n|27.3\n|-\n|31\n|27.8\n|-\n|32\n|28.3\n|-\n|33\n|28.8\n|-\n|34\n|29.2\n|-\n|35\n|29.7\n|-\n|36\n|30.2\n|-\n|37\n|30.6\n|-\n|38\n|31.1\n|-\n|39\n|31.6\n|-\n|40\n|32\n|-\n|41\n|32.5\n|-\n|42\n|33\n|-\n|43\n|33.5\n|-\n|44\n|33.9\n|-\n|45\n|34.4\n|-\n|46\n|34.9\n|-\n|47\n|35.4\n|-\n|48\n|35.9\n|-\n|49\n|36.4\n|-\n|50\n|36.9\n|-\n|51\n|37.4\n|-\n|52\n|38\n|-\n|53\n|38.5\n|-\n|54\n|39.1\n|-\n|55\n|39.7\n|-\n|56\n|40.2\n|-\n|57\n|40.8\n|-\n|58\n|41.5\n|-\n|59\n|42.1\n|-\n|60\n|42.8\n|-\n|61\n|43.4\n|-\n|62\n|44.1\n|-\n|63\n|44.8\n|-\n|64\n|45.6\n|-\n|65\n|46.3\n|-\n|66\n|47.1\n|-\n|67\n|48\n|-\n|68\n|48.8\n|-\n|69\n|49.7\n|-\n|70\n|50.6\n|-\n|71\n|51.6\n|-\n|72\n|52.5\n|-\n|73\n|53.6\n|-\n|74\n|54.6\n|-\n|75\n|55.7\n|-\n|76\n|56.9\n|-\n|77\n|58.1\n|-\n|78\n|59.3\n|-\n|79\n|60.6\n|-\n|80\n|61.9\n|-\n|81\n|63.3\n|-\n|82\n|64.7\n|-\n|83\n|66.2\n|-\n|84\n|67.8\n|-\n|85\n|69.4\n|-\n|86\n|71.1\n|-\n|